---
// src/components/TravelCTA.astro
---

<section class="mt-16 border-t pt-10">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Plan Your Travel to India</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 max-w-2xl">
    After we confirm your treatment plan, our team will guide you on where to fly
    and stay. To get a quick idea of flight and hotel costs from your country,
    you can use the travel search tool below.
  </p>
  <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-600">
    <li>• From: your home city / nearest airport</li>
    <li>• To: Delhi, Mumbai, Chennai, Bengaluru or Hyderabad</li>
    <li>• Dates: your preferred treatment dates</li>
  </ul>

  <a
    href="https://www.skyscanner.net"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener"
    class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 text-white text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-slate-800"
  >
    Open Skyscanner – Check Travel Prices
  </a>
</section>
